swadesh subclasses sacreBLEU's BLEU and CHRF classes, depends on sacreBLEU 2.6.0 at
runtime, and computes corpus scores with sacreBLEU's own code. The tokenizer logic
(13a, intl, zh, char) is a port of sacreBLEU's tokenizers, and the native TER work in
progress is a port of sacreBLEU's TER implementation.
